{"id":"Wca050ca729aa5a5e6ff577c9","zh":"轨道不平顺随机模型","en":"","name":"轨道不平顺随机模型","language":"zh","domain":"轨道不平顺建模","concept_id":"C6ea8abe3101a6a58ef93","families":[{"id":"geometry.irregularity","label":"轨道不平顺及其表征"}],"definition_zh":"利用 Karhunen–Loève 展开和混沌多项式表达轨道不平顺随机过程的特定模型，可用于压缩实测不平顺信号并识别其相关性。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":"TISM 指轨道不平顺随机模型，与 TIPM 所指概率模型分别保留。","usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"这里指以 K–L 展开等方式压缩实测不平顺信息的特定模型，主要用于不平顺随机模拟，并与概率模型比较所生成的激励及动力响应分布；不能泛指一切轨道不平顺的随机生成方法。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wca050ca729aa5a5e6ff577c9","text":"轨道不平顺随机模型","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S3b7953a3e84bb0df240d","source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"迄今为止,以法国科研人员在轨道不平顺随机模型方面的研究最为突出。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S17c0f110cf2d0fed2144","source_id":"P115","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"采用2种轨道不平顺随机模型可以极大减少计算量。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":5,"page_end":5}]}],"sources":{"P003":{"id":"P003","title":"A probabilistic model for track random irregularities in vehicle/track coupled dynamics","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai, J Gao","year":"2017","doi":"10.1016/j.apm.2017.06.027","journal_citation":"Applied Mathematical Modelling 51, 145-158","label":"Xu等（2017）","overview_slug":"xu-2017-track-irregularity"},"P115":{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal_citation":"交通运输工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[{"id":"W6902463116c8984865845001","target_concept_id":"W6902463116c8984865845001","target_zh":"Karhunen–Loève展开","target_en":null,"label":"相关术语","reason":"TISM采用K–L展开表达随机过程。"}],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"采用K-L展开压缩实测不平顺信息的比较模型。","language":"zh","source_id":"P115","paper_s